# Cloudflare Pages redirects (same syntax as Netlify)
#
# The previous catch-all `/* /index.html 200` made EVERY unknown URL return
# HTTP 200 with the full homepage. That produced infinite duplicate URLs and
# soft-404s for Google and AI crawlers (e.g. /llms.txt was serving the homepage).
#
# Cloudflare Pages already serves `404.html` with a real 404 status for any
# path that does not match a static file, so no catch-all is needed here.
# Do not re-add `/* /index.html 200`.
